{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act32side_level_act32side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act32side",
  "stageId": "act32side_01",
  "title": "城市主題展",
  "storyCode": "CR-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0cd2c809f6b5157161d3c56cd6e9770fec700449c914173ce68c29ca7793a238",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，ELA小姐，你的朋友們沒一起來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你僱的安保人員對FUZE很“感興趣”，在底下纏著他問東問西。剛好你也想派個人訓練他們，我就把他留在那裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得你們昨天有四個人呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前我們應該說好了，一半的人手保護你，其他人會繼續進行我們在這裡的搜尋任務，只在需要人手的時候加入進來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天你又不出席什麼公眾活動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別繃著臉嘛，不過是好奇問兩句。事實上，跟著我的人越少我反而越輕鬆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到了，你今天的行程裡有兩場會議，保密度極高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "會議？什麼會議？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g20_skyblue_L1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "高空彈跳？這就是你的“會議”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，之前米沃什根本不允許我來玩，他今天在外面辦事，我當然要抓住這個機會來試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……身為保鏢，我建議你放棄這個計劃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那作為雇主，我建議你少提些建議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的安全帶調整好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒問題，先生，您可以往下跳了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那……回頭見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇哦————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……這傢伙真是個混帳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姐，您不必緊張，我們使用的都是專業設備，不會有什麼危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果沒有危險，你就不會讓他去填那份免責聲明了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那您還跳嗎？安全裝置我已經為您綁好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，為什麼不呢，反正是我老闆掏錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "背對跳台，ELA站到邊緣處，腳跟的懸空讓她產生了絲絲麻意，順著被綁束的地方蔓延上背脊。\n對著工作人員，她輕輕扯出一個笑容，隨即向後倒去，享受被失重感捏緊心臟的快意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在不停降落的過程中，ELA等待著繩索延展到極致，然後回彈，將她向上牽拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但在耳旁呼嘯的風聲裡，她先聽到了水花綻開的聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*粗口*，那個沃爾珀居然自己解開了自己的安全扣？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gówno！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G02"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廣告",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海濱風光無限，莫讓陽光灼傷臉頰，“大帽老哥”防曬霜，讓你的肌膚遠離紫外線的傷害。現在訂購還可獲贈一套尾巴護理油……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "邁耶，你在看什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那邊的……呃，貓耳女郎，在向路人派發這些東西，我就順手拿了一張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確實，這地方紫外線強度的確比較高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我是在看這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "磨角石？打錯了吧，是不是角質——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "興奮的萊塔尼亞旅客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_496_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想不到戰事頻傳的玻利瓦爾竟然藏了這麼一個度假勝地，這次出差我原本都不想來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高興的萊塔尼亞旅客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_499_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，這幾天過得很開心，就是角在鹽水裡泡久了之後變得很粗糙，等一會回旅館得好好打磨一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傳單上還有沃爾珀、魯珀和菲林專用的毛髮柔軟精。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十公升大包裝？耳朵和尾巴用得到這麼多嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的敘拉古遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1000_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在到了一批好貨，明天我們在沙灘浴場見面時細談。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的敘拉古遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_601_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，希望它們對得起我出的價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……他們確實需要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實話說，現在無論看見什麼，我都不會覺得奇怪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的薩科塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不屑地皺眉）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嫌棄地繞走）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……上帝啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主持人的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……讓我們歡迎今天的嘉賓，多索雷斯的文化產業新秀，雷內爾·科瓦爾斯基先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感謝多索雷斯電視台給我一個被電視機前的觀眾唾罵的機會，也感謝電視台給這些觀眾一條發洩壓力的途徑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，那不是克里斯達爾藝術館的老闆嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想不到在街道上也能聽到那傢伙的聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道ELA和FUZE能不能與他和平相處，直覺告訴我那是個相當能惹人生氣的傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賭場打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去去去，不賭就別來店門口晃！看你穿的那一身行頭，嚇得客人都不來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭藝術家",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我前幾天來過的，就站在這裡宣傳自己社區的狂歡節，又不趕你們的客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賭場打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你最好別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭藝術家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，大哥，有沒有興趣來看看我們社區的東西？來，這是傳單！我們街頭藝術社區有一場真正的藝術狂歡節！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝，恐怕我們有自己的事情要做，所以……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭藝術家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們不會是要去那個玻璃屋子的開幕式吧？別被那傢伙宣傳的東西騙了，他懂個屁的藝術！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭藝術家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_021",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，拿著吧，傳單而已，看看嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傳單上寫了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別說，如果他們真的能做出來，我還挺想去看看的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我可以向各位保證，此次開幕式將會激發多索雷斯在文化藝術領域的產業活力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為此我和員工們準備了一系列的併購計劃、商業提振計劃、產業升級計劃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這將成為一個重大契機，克里斯達爾藝術館的建立將為多索雷斯的經濟發展提供強大的推力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起這個來，我確實更想看看傳單上的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳……*粗口*，這個混帳是瘋了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_beach_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醒醒！你這混蛋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能摸到你的脈搏，少給我裝死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘔……咳咳，哈哈哈哈……咳咳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一次小小的率性而為罷了，在離水面最近的地方，解開束縛自己的安全扣，自由地落入水中……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不比單純地隨著繩子上躥下跳有意思多了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……雷內爾先生，很抱歉，我認為我無法繼續承擔您的安保工作。感謝您提供的住處，明天我會和伙伴們搬離那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離職？不至於吧，你這麼生氣的嗎？別這麼緊張，我試過從更誇張的高度入水，真的，這不還是活得好好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我無法保護一個拿自己生命開玩笑的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你誤會了，ELA小姐，我有個計劃多年的目標，在完成它之前，我會把自己的生命看得比什麼都重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "記得把身上的水擦擦，別著涼了，看得出……你的身體並沒有“我們”這麼強壯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_offce"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道嗎？一隻腳跨進這扇門的時候，回不回得去就由不得你自己了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是帶著好意來的，馬特奧上尉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好意？我的人剛被你老闆好好“招待”了一番，今天你就帶著好意上門了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上尉，您和雷內爾為什麼非要鬧個你死我活呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那好啊，我想要街頭藝術社區那塊地，讓他直接拱手讓給我啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "擋我的路，就是擋玻利瓦爾聯合政府的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個除了錢什麼都沒有的卡西米爾人，別以為僱得起幾個傭兵就能跟聯合政府的代言人談判了，他還沒那個資格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雷內爾並不想和您爭那塊地的所有權。如果我們雙方能達成合作，他很願意把那塊地讓給您……或者讓給聯合政府，沒什麼差別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你替他說了算？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……我的意思代表了他的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果沒有那場不周密的綁架，我們本應該在更和睦的氣氛下聊這些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你指責我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那只是一場不幸的誤會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用給我台階下，我不在乎這些。你最好直接告訴我事實，雷內爾到底想從我這裡得到什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在玻利瓦爾立足，如果沒有您這樣有背景的人支持，怎麼可以呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在軍隊裡的日子比在學校裡多，聽不懂你們在繞什麼，有話直說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……那片社區與其說是流浪藝術家的聚居區，不如說是幫派橫行的法外之地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們之前有過開發那裡的計劃，但裡面的人一個比一個凶悍。更重要的是，那裡還生活著一些感染者，非常難辦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，說白了還是你們手上只有錢，以為在多索雷斯什麼都能用錢解決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，總歸是有能力解決問題的人才配享用最後的果實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉各位，我對各位的作戰風格和戰術素養還一無所知，對此最快的瞭解方法是直接進行一場攻防戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "四人一組，兩組對戰，三局兩勝。對局的核心是解救人質。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "進攻方需要確認人質所在並將其從所在地安全帶走，防守方需要阻止進攻方營救人質。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說得夠清楚吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保全們",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多嘴的保全",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那誰是人質？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "公平起見，我來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "進攻方保全A",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "報告！我從窗戶進來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "進攻方保全A",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個房間完全沒人！我去下一個房間看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "進攻方保全B",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是怎樣……走路不長眼睛嗎？噓！動作小點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "進攻方保全A",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明是你沒看路撞老子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "進攻方保全B",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能不能安靜點！你要去的那幾個方向我都搜過了，沒有看到人，你沒聽通訊裡面講嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "進攻方保全A",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "通訊？什麼通訊？你是說這個？這東西剛剛掉窗戶外面了，正好找你要個新的。趕快給我一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "防守方保全A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十幾公尺外就能聽到這大嗓門了。報告，消滅兩人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "防守方保全B",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老兄，能不能拜託你配合下，蹲到這個板子後面，最好露個頭頂，這樣就能吸引他們過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "防守方保全C",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們三個人守著唯一的門，他們進來一個我們打一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……就不怕我受傷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "防守方保全D",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼可能受傷，他們進來的時候，就被我們消滅掉了，哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "防守方保全B",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*粗口*，是源石技藝！我看不見了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "防守方保全C",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們、他們從窗戶進來了！別過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "進攻方保全C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "成功找到人質，屋裡還有三個傻子在門口等我們，可惜進攻又不是只有這一條路能走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "進攻方保全D",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個閃光的源石技藝看著挺有效的……等一下，那個人在……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "防守方保全C",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惡！別過來！都別想靠近我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "進攻方保全C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "報告，報告！這個人被晃瞎了正在亂攻擊！可惡！我隊友呢！怎麼人都倒了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*俄語粗口*，全都停下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是讓我大開眼界了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "48_g5_galleries"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想不到你這麼早就回來了，我不在身邊，你現在不該對那些平常我禁止你去的地方躍躍欲試嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出了些小意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "受傷了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，是ELA小姐不幹了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這已經是你氣走的第三十二個私人保鏢了，我不可能一直陪著你，我自己還有工作要做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先換個話題，你跟那位上尉談得怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他上鉤了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不錯，接下來就看看我們在那片社區的“朋友們”如何表現了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他之後還有得頭痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，和社區那些藝術家來來回回鬥了這麼久，他們惹麻煩的能力我還是清楚的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗨，ELA小姐，離職手續辦得怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很失敗，沒人告訴我人事部的人今天不上班。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒辦法，我手底下的員工一向如此隨心所欲，說來就來，說走就走，我也很頭痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，在離開前有件事我得告訴您，特展區中心那座雕塑是贗品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它和那位雕塑家的其他作品比起來有幾處細微的不同，您可能得查一查這座雕塑的來歷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許您被藝術品販子騙了，對您這樣的商人來說，這也算是常事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噗——噗哈哈哈哈，ELA小姐，我現在有點不想讓你走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看得很準，真的很準。那座雕塑是我仿的，我覺得還不錯，就把它放在那裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雕塑擺在那裡這麼長時間，除了你，沒有一個人看出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許是因為他們看出來了也不敢駁您這位大老闆的面子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然這對雷內爾先生您來說不是問題，那我和我的朋友便離開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢著，ELA小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果之後我安分一點，你能繼續為我工作嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）還真是罕見……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您在挽留我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你難道就不想看看那座雕塑的真品嗎？你觀察得那麼仔細，一定在那位雕塑家的作品處停了很久吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望您真的能像您保證的那樣安分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃內斯托，我們到多索雷斯還有多遠啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照現在的速度，就快了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這話你已經說了好幾天了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的快到了……等把這批新藥送到當地人手裡，我一定介紹個又有陽光，又有沙灘，又能一躺一整天的地方給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且遠離賭場和酒吧，包你滿意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "酒吧之類的倒也還好，畢竟借酒消愁的人我也能理解……等下，你怎麼知道我不喜歡賭場？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也是第一次帶搭檔的幹員回多索雷斯，自然是要周到接待的，所以出發前特意去找梓蘭姐問了你的喜好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，我離開家鄉的事……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勇敢的義舉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我後來又回家鄉的事……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可敬的抉擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，又不是什麼難以啟齒的經歷，只是這些光榮事蹟明明應該在酒酣耳熱的時候一口氣講出來的，現在嘛……唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到了多索雷斯，記得請我喝一杯，就當是聽故事的報酬了，怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "樂意之至。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
